<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica Apr manufacturing output at all-time high.</title>
<headline>SAfrica Apr manufacturing output at all-time high.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African manufacturing production hit an all-time high in April, rising 7.6 percent on a seasonally-adjusted basis compared with the same month a year ago, the Central Statistical Service (CSS) said.</p>
<p>Month-on-month, seasonally-adjusted manufacturing production was up 12.2 percent.</p>
<p>Manufacturers said the rise was due to a longer production month, more orders completed and an increase in exports</p>
<p>Index of the physical volume of manufacturing production</p>
<p>(base 1990=100):</p>
<p>				 Apr '97	 Mar '97	Apr '96</p>
<p>    Seasonally adjusted  112.1	    99.9	  104.2</p>
<p>    Actual		   105.2	   103.9	   97.7</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
